## 4. 模板（Templates）

### 列表查询

```java
public PageResult<GetXxxListVo> getXxxList(GetXxxListDto dto) {
    XxxPo query = new XxxPo();
    assign(dto, query);
    Page<XxxPo> page = repository.getXxxList(query, dto.pageRequest());
    if (page.isEmpty()) {
        return PageResult.successWithEmpty();
    }
    List<GetXxxListVo> vos = as(page.getContent(), GetXxxListVo.class);
    return PageResult.success(vos, (int) page.getTotalElements());
}
```

### 新增

```java
@Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)
public void addXxx(AddXxxDto dto) throws BizException {
    XxxPo insertPo = as(dto, XxxPo.class);
    repository.save(insertPo);
}
```

### 编辑

```java
@Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)
public void editXxx(EditXxxDto dto) throws BizException {
    XxxPo updatePo = repository.findById(dto.getId())
            .orElseThrow(() -> new BizException("更新失败,数据不存在或无权限访问."));
    assign(dto, updatePo);
    repository.save(updatePo);
}
```

### 详情

```java
public GetXxxDetailsVo getXxxDetails(CommonIdDto dto) throws BizException {
    XxxPo po = repository.findById(dto.getId())
            .orElseThrow(() -> new BizException("查询详情失败,数据不存在或无权限访问."));
    return as(po, GetXxxDetailsVo.class);
}
```

### 删除

```java
@Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)
public void removeXxx(CommonIdDto dto) throws BizException {
    if (dto.isBatch()) {
        repository.deleteAllById(dto.getIds());
        return;
    }
    repository.deleteById(dto.getId());
}
```

### Tuple 列表 + 导出

```java
public PageResult<GetXxxListVo> getXxxList(GetXxxListDto dto) {
    Page<Tuple> page = repository.getXxxList(dto, dto.pageRequest());
    if (page.isEmpty()) {
        return PageResult.successWithEmpty();
    }
    List<GetXxxListVo> vos = TupleMapper.tupleAs(page.getContent(), GetXxxListVo.class);
    return PageResult.success(vos, (int) page.getTotalElements());
}

public List<ExportXxxVo> exportXxx(GetXxxListDto dto) {
    /* 查询 + as / tupleAs 转为 ExportXxxVo 列表 */
}
```

### MyBatis 列表（JPA 无法满足时）

```java
@Autowired
private XxxMapper xxxMapper;

public PageResult<GetXxxListVo> getXxxList(GetXxxListDto dto) {
    int total = xxxMapper.countXxxList(dto);
    if (total == 0) {
        return PageResult.successWithEmpty();
    }
    List<GetXxxListVo> vos = xxxMapper.selectXxxList(dto, dto.pageRequest());
    return PageResult.success(vos, total);
}
```

```java
// XxxMapper.java — com.ksptool.bio.biz.xxx.mapper
@Mapper
public interface XxxMapper {
    int countXxxList(@Param("dto") GetXxxListDto dto);
    List<GetXxxListVo> selectXxxList(@Param("dto") GetXxxListDto dto, @Param("pageable") Pageable pageable);
}
```

